entries.text:
After the last upgrade, students still reported that the mechcraft challenge was too simple. Therefore, based on hitting circular targets to complete the challenge, the creator has launched a super-upgraded challenge mechanism!
This challenge mechanism uses brand-new mechanism parts. Students are welcome to participate!
Challenge Reminders:
First, keep your distance when the mechanism is lifting to avoid injury;
Second, clear your mind, stay focused, and do not be distracted by external influences;
Third, please collect your unlocked rewards in a timely manner;
Fourth, any feedback or suggestions are welcome via mail to the Mechcraft Academy. Please do not graffiti on the notice board.

(A line of handwritten text)
Recycling old and discarded mechanism parts at your door, fair prices guaranteed.

A civilized and harmonious academy environment directly concerns the vital interests of every student. To ensure a pleasant learning experience, please observe the following covenants:

First, maintain environmental hygiene and protect the ecological environment;
Second, observe public order and protect cultural relics and historic sites;
Third, cherish academy facilities and conserve cloud-silk resources;
Fourth, respect the schools of thought of the hundred philosophers and actively develop academics;
Fifth, practice courtesy toward others and maintain neat and proper attire.

Mechanisms are difficult, but their benefits are endless. Students, please persevere in your practice and do not give up lightly.

Challenge Tips:
First: Eyes, mind, and hands working together are the keys to success;
Second: Hit a certain number of round targets to complete the challenge;
Third: Do not destroy the mechanism with brute force;
Fourth: Please claim your unlocked rewards promptly.

Notice:
Sima Yi, a student of the School of Sorcery, entered the Forbidden Chamber without the permission of the Forbidden Warden and attempted to release a dangerous creation. This is a formal reprimand!
His punishment is as follows:
First, write a self-reflection of one thousand words to deeply reflect on his actions;
Second, perform mandatory cleaning duties for the Forbidden Pavilion for two weeks, obeying the instructions of the Forbidden Warden during this period, and approaching any Forbidden Chamber is strictly prohibited;
Third, submit a detailed report of the intrusion route and the methods used to crack the defenses to assist the Forbidden Pavilion in upgrading its defense mechanisms.

Snowy sharks leap, while dragons dive;
Through darkening tides, the barriers fall;
In dreamlike realms, an inventor ascends,
With cunning art, the world he amends.

Contraption Master joyfully inscribed this poem after unearthing a treasured in the Oneirland

To all martial artists at You Shan Pavilion:

Recently, the number of martial artists coming here to train has increased. To maintain our shared Accumulation Stone training ground, we encourage everyone to follow these guidelines as closely as possible:
First, be humble, courteous, and friendly;
Second, observe quietly and whisper softly;
Third, be understanding and respectful, and do not resort to violence;
Fourth, keep a calm mind and communicate to learn.

Note: If you wish to spar or test your skills, please move to the Cloud Cultivation Terrace.

Recently, some students have commented that the Mechcraft challenge is too easy. To meet everyone's challenge needs, the creator has upgraded the gameplay while keeping the requirement of hitting three round targets to complete the challenge.
Please explore the upgrades yourselves!
Challenge Reminders:
First, students should take turns challenging the mechanisms in an orderly manner without damaging the surrounding buildings and mechanism apparatus;
Second, please reset the mechanisms after the challenge is completed for the convenience of other students;
Third, please be diligent in thinking and observant; brute-force cracking is not recommended.

Forest Entry Procedure:
First, fill out the forest entry application form;
Second, submit the application form to the student union representative at the application office;
Third, obtain Zhisheng's approval for the application form;
Fourth, complete the forest entry registration.

Given the recent frequent intrusions into the Forbidden Pavilion by unrelated personnel, relevant Forbidden Specialists are required to further improve the defense mechanisms. The preliminary planning and specific arrangements are as follows:
First, Forbidden Specialists whose responsible areas have been breached shall thoroughly investigate the loopholes and weaknesses in the current defense mechanisms and submit a written document to the relevant responsible persons for study;
Second, widely recruit talented individuals from Changan Academy and the Hundred Schools of Thought, preferably three to five from mechanisms, sorcery, and martial arts respectively;
Third, the mechanism Forbidden Specialists shall lead the craftsmen to discuss the development of defensive mechanisms; the sorcery Forbidden Specialists shall lead the sorcerers to discuss the deployment of defensive arrays; in addition, form a cooperative relationship with the martial arts mentors to discuss strengthening the basic training of Forbidden Specialists;
Fourth, all newly added defense mechanisms are intended for intimidation and expulsion purposes and should not adopt highly aggressive means. The final proposed plan shall be submitted to the head of the Forbidden Pavilion for review and approval.

Once enabled, you can adjust the camera position using keyboard shortcuts and the mouse:
Mouse Left/Right = Camera Yaw Adjustment;
Mouse Forward/Backward = Camera Pitch Adjustment;
Up Arrow = Move Camera Forward;
Down Arrow = Move Camera Backward;
Left Arrow = Move Camera Left;
Right Arrow = Move Camera Right;
NumPad 8 = Move Camera Vertically Up;
NumPad 5 = Move Camera Vertically Down;
NumPad 4 = Roll Camera Left;
NumPad 6 = Roll Camera Right;
M = Camera Ground Movement Mode (enables easier camera control on the ground).
